  "instance_name": "relatable_meme_culture",
  "label": "Relatable Meme Culture",
  "description": "The meme format relies on the concept of 'relatability' — a cultural phenomenon where internet users share humorous or exaggerated images to express shared experiences or emotions. The phrase 'when you've had a long day' is a common trope in meme culture, used to evoke empathy and laughter by connecting with the viewer's own experiences of fatigue or laziness.",
